Subject: [PATCH] Restore Molly's badges, locked debug log details and dynamic
 colors

AI-assisted compatibility changes. The port lost three Molly 8.19.2-4
behaviors that a later fix on another branch restored but that never
reached this release: contact settings show the recipient's badges again,
with their names for accessibility; the debug log's system information no
longer reads the locked SignalStore for the first installed version; and
dynamic-color themes use Molly's light extended-color base again.

